-- @regex("Index Reader Param", false)
➤ TP QUERY PLAN[12,0,0]  𝄀
Project  𝄀
  ->  Sort  𝄀
        Sort Key: serial_extract(__mo_index_idx_col, 0, INT)) INTERNAL  𝄀
        Limit: 1  𝄀
        ->  Join  𝄀
              Join Type: INNER   hashOnPK  𝄀
              Join Cond: (u.id = __mo_index_pri_col)  𝄀
              Runtime Filter Build: #[-1,0]  𝄀
              ->  Table Scan on force_index_order.limit_u  𝄀
                    Runtime Filter Probe: u.id  𝄀
              ->  Index Table Scan on limit_j.ix_limit_a  𝄀
                    Sort Key: __mo_index_idx_col INTERNAL
select j.id,j.a from limit_j j force index for order by(ix_limit_a)
join limit_u u on j.id=u.id order by j.a limit 1;
