                    ->  Table Scan on force_index_order.suffix_j [ForceOneCN]  𝄀
                          Runtime Filter Probe: j.id  𝄀
                    ->  Index Table Scan on suffix_j.ix_suffix [ForceOneCN]  𝄀
                          Runtime Filter Probe: __mo_index_idx_col Match Prefix  𝄀
              ->  Table Scan on force_index_order.suffix_u
