              ->  Index Table Scan on t.ix_ab [ForceOneCN]  𝄀
                    Filter Cond: prefix_between(__mo_index_idx_col), serial_extract(__mo_index_idx_col, 1, INT)) BETWEEN 1 AND 2  𝄀
